  <h2> About Wolfe's Pond Beach </h2>
    <nav>
     <a href="https://www.google.com/maps/dir//Wolfe's+Pond+Beach,+Holton+to,+Wolfe's+Pond+Park,+Cornelia+Ave,+Staten+Island,+NY+10312/@40.5182403,-74.1888392,17z/data=!4m9!4m8!1m0!1m5!1m1!1s0x89c24bbdf1d35e1f:0x6e926a5cea979e3d!2m2!1d-74.1866505!2d40.5182362!3e0?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDgwNS4xIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D"> Wolfe's Pond Beach, Staten Island, NY </a>
